ily:Arial;color:rgb(184,49,47);\">It was registered but has never been logged into;</li><li style=\"list-style:disc;white-space:nowrap;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(184,49,47);\">It has had no order activity for a continuous period of six (6) months.</li></ul><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px;color:rgb(9,44,76);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;color:rgb(184,49,47);\">We also maintain a zero-tolerance policy toward fraudulent or abusive behavior. This includes, but is not limited to:</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:10px;color:rgb(9,44,76);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><li style=\"list-style:disc;white-space:nowrap;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(184,49,47);\">The generation of malicious traffic;</li><li style=\"list-style:disc;white-space:nowrap;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(184,49,47);\">Fake add-to-cart activities;</li><li style=\"list-style:disc;white-space:nowrap;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(184,49,47);\">Submission of fraudulent orders.</li></ul><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px;color:rgb(9,44,76);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;color:rgb(184,49,47);\">Any affiliate account