normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><li style=\"list-style:disc;white-space:nowrap;color:rgb(184,49,47);\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">Bidding on brand-related keywords or misspellings (e.g., \"Rabbitgoo\", \"Rabittgoo harness\", etc.)</span></li><li style=\"list-style:disc;white-space:nowrap;color:rgb(184,49,47);\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">Direct linking to our website using affiliate URLs in paid ads</span></li><li style=\"list-style:disc;white-space:nowrap;color:rgb(184,49,47);\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">Using Google Ads to generate artificial clicks or inflate referral traffic</span></li><li style=\"list-style:disc;white-space:nowrap;color:rgb(184,49,47);\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">Violating this policy may result in:</span></li><li style=\"list-style:disc;white-space:nowrap;color:rgb(184,49,47);\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">Suspension or removal from the affiliate program</span></li><li style=\"list-style:disc;white-space:nowrap;color:rgb(184,49,47);\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">Cancellation of pending commissions</span></li><li style=\"list-style:disc;white-space:nowrap;color:rgb(184,49,47);\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">Blacklisting of future applications</span></li></ul><h3 style=\"font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.1;color:rgb(9,44,76);margin-top:5px;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-size:24px;color:rgb(184,49,47);\">3. Prohibited Advertising Practices: Use of Facebook Ads</span></h3><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px;co